   "text": "QB1 \u00b7 The board folder: where it lives, what it holds, and what we may write into one we do not own",
   "originalText": "QB1 \u00b7 The board folder: where it lives, what it holds, and what we may write into one we do not own",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
